/// * `nonce` must be valid for reads of 12 bytes.
/// * `aad` must be valid for reads of `aad_len` bytes.
/// * `data` must be valid for reads and writes of `len` bytes.
/// * `tag` must be valid for reads and writes of 16 bytes.
